lf; First Presbyterian un-mirrored (#1215)\n\nThe context generator tested a projected stand-in's centre and corners against parcels and\nblocks only, so one stood on 18th Street's curve into Calumet Avenue, faded streets lay in the\nIllinois Central's tracks, sheds stacked inside each other and trees stood in roadways.\n\n- clear_city(): every stand-in tested as its whole rectangle against the grid's carriageways,\n  walks, parkways, curbs and alleys, the right of way (data/railway/1904_context.json) plus a\n  3 m fence strip, the faded streets and every kept stand-in; cut back or dropped. Trees too.\n- East of Calumet below its curve the lots run back to the right of way (Sanborn 1911 sheet 28\n  at 20th Street); faded streets are cut by the right of way and end square to 0.1 m.\n- Each projected block draws from its own seed.\n- contract()/--self-test fail on every overlap, including the owner's exact case.\n- draft_prairie_1904.site_record(): a west-fronted site's v figures are mirrored into the\n  record's frame; First Presbyterian (T-3009) stood across 21st Street. Rebuilt.\n- L-context-streets-2491 amended; before/after shots in docs/RESEARCH/context-clear-3038.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QHFtemh6eb56VtMwJL6YEu\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-22T21:50:33Z","author":{"name":"Kevin Haas","email":"kevinroberthaas@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1384299918,"node_id":"R_kgDOUoK9jg","name":"chicago","full_name":"kevinrhaas/chicago","private":false,"owner":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","