 mansard's plain stacks. Every other K01 house re-emits\nbyte-identical (31 restamped in the manifest). Read through T-2538's\ncamera; sections and patterns reconstructed\n(L-kimball-1801-deck-cresting-3000). The curb's own offset from the print\nis added to T-1890 as a finding.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* T-3000: add left to right in the hood's face centres (T-2363), restamp the manifest, rebuild source-use backlinks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* T-3000: re-derive liberties after merging dev\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* T-3000: merge dev (T-2978); re-derive liberties\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* T-3000: rebuild source-use coverage after merging dev\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: polecat-steward <steward@polecat.live>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-22T21:45:30Z","author":{"name":"Kevin Haas","email":"kevinroberthaas@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1384299918,"node_id":"R_kgDOUoK9jg","name":"chicago","full_name":"kevinrhaas/chicago","private":false,"owner":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/use