 the Green Tree Tavern on its ground in 1835 (#1207)\n\n* T-3029: set the Green Tree Tavern on its ground in 1835\n\nBuildings are bedded on the ground under their walls' feet (triangle edges on\ny = 0) instead of a grid over the mesh bounding box, whose eaves and empty\ncorners beside a wing reached ground no wall stands on. The Green Tree is\nre-seated 5.80 m west so its rear ell sits off the bank's slope; walk, yard\ngoods, woodpile, sidecar and stand re-derived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KTCexGPjG4S9FvBiGZWVvS\n\n* T-3029: West Water's end follows the re-seated inn; 1835 ground re-graded\n\nThe cut rule that stops West Water at the Green Tree moves the street's end\n3.17 m along the same bank segment. The e1834 heightfield and terrain GLB are\nre-baked (the bpy 4.5.3 bake reproduces dev's bytes first), and the West\nDivision plat, lot, yard and fence layers that read the line are re-derived.\nThe covered-wagon terrain pins are re-qualified: no changed cell is near a stand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KTCexGPjG4S9FvBiGZWVvS\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-22T19:32:18Z","author":{"name":"Kevin Haas","email":"kevinroberthaas@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1384299918,"node_id":"R_kgDOUoK9jg","name":"chicago","full_name":"kevinrhaas/chicago","private":false,"owner":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/